msgctxt "#13441"
msgid "Use MPEG-2 VDPAU"
msgstr "Koristite MPEG-2 VDPAU"

#. Description of setting with label #13441 "Use MPEG-2 VDPAU"
msgctxt "#13442"
msgid "Enable this option to use hardware acceleration for MPEG-(1 / 2) codecs. If disabled the CPU will be used instead. Older Radeon Cards tend to segfault with this enabled."
msgstr "Omogućite ovu opciju da biste koristili hardversko ubrzanje za MPEG-(1/2) kodeke. Ako je onemogućena, umjesto toga će se koristiti CPU. Starije Radeon kartice imaju tendenciju da uzrokuju greške segmentacije kada je ova opcija omogućena."

msgctxt "#13443"
msgid "Use MPEG-4 VDPAU"
msgstr "Koristite MPEG-4 VDPAU"

#. Description of setting with label #13443 "Use MPEG-4 VDPAU"
msgctxt "#13444"
msgid "Enable this option to use hardware acceleration for the MPEG-4 codec. If disabled the CPU will be used instead. Some ION hardware has problems with this being enabled by default."
msgstr "Omogućite ovu opciju da biste koristili hardversko ubrzanje za MPEG-4 kodek. Ako je onemogućena, umjesto toga će se koristiti CPU. Neki ION hardver ima problema s tim da je ovo omogućeno po zadanim postavkama."

msgctxt "#13445"
msgid "Use VC-1 VDPAU"
msgstr "Koristite VC-1 VDPAU"

#. Description of setting with label #13445 "Use VC-1 VDPAU"
msgctxt "#13446"
msgid "Enable this option to use hardware acceleration for VC-1 based codecs. If disabled the CPU will be used instead. AMD hardware with VDPAU can't decode VC-1 Simple."
msgstr "Omogućite ovu opciju da biste koristili hardversko ubrzanje za VC-1 kodeke. Ako je onemogućena, umjesto toga će se koristiti CPU. AMD hardver sa VDPAU ne može dekodirati VC-1 Simple."

msgctxt "#13447"
msgid "Use MPEG-2 VAAPI"
msgstr "Koristite MPEG-2 VAAPI"

#. Description of setting with label #13447 "Use MPEG-2 VAAPI"
msgctxt "#13448"
msgid "Enable this option to use hardware acceleration for MPEG-(1 / 2) codecs. If disabled the CPU will be used instead. Some MPEG-2 videos might have green artifacts."
msgstr "Omogućite ovu opciju da biste koristili hardversko ubrzanje za MPEG-(1/2) kodeke. Ako je onemogućena, umjesto toga će se koristiti CPU. Neki MPEG-2 videozapisi mogu imati zelene artefakte."

msgctxt "#13449"
msgid "Use MPEG-4 VAAPI"
msgstr "Koristite MPEG-4 VAAPI"

#. Description of setting with label #13449 "Use MPEG-4 VAAPI"
msgctxt "#13450"
msgid "Enable this option to use hardware acceleration for the MPEG-4 codec. If disabled the CPU will be used instead."
msgstr "Omogućite ovu opciju da biste koristili hardversko ubrzanje za MPEG-4 kodek. Ako je onemogućena, umjesto toga će se koristiti CPU."

msgctxt "#13451"
msgid "Use VC-1 VAAPI"
msgstr "Koristite VC-1 VAAPI"

#. Description of setting with label #13451 "Use VC-1 VAAPI"
msgctxt "#13452"
msgid "Enable this option to use hardware acceleration for VC-1 based codecs. If disabled the CPU will be used instead. Especially VC-1 interlaced fails hard on Intel hardware."
msgstr "Omogućite ovu opciju da biste koristili hardversko ubrzanje za VC-1 kodeke. Ako je onemogućena, umjesto toga će se koristiti CPU. Posebno VC-1 interlaced kodiranje teško pada na Intel hardveru."

msgctxt "#13453"
msgid "Use VP8 VAAPI"
msgstr "Koristite VP8 VAAPI"

#. Description of setting with label #13453 "Use VP8 VAAPI"
msgctxt "#13454"
msgid "Enable this option to use hardware acceleration for the VP8 codec. If disabled the CPU will be used instead."
msgstr "Omogućite ovu opciju da biste koristili hardversko ubrzanje za VP8 kodek. Ako je onemogućena, umjesto toga će se koristiti CPU."

msgctxt "#13455"
msgid "Use VP9 VAAPI"
msgstr "Koristite VP9 VAAPI"

#. Description of setting with label #13453 "Use VP9 VAAPI"
msgctxt "#13456"
msgid "Enable this option to use hardware acceleration for the VP9 codec. If disabled the CPU will be used instead."
msgstr "Omogućite ovu opciju da biste koristili hardversko ubrzanje za VP9 kodek. Ako je onemogućena, umjesto toga će se koristiti CPU."

#. Option for video related setting #13454: sw filter
msgctxt "#13457"
msgid "Prefer VAAPI render method"
msgstr "Preferira se VAAPI metoda renderiranja"

#. This filter disables certain Android software decoders, leaving only hardware decoders available for video playback.
msgctxt "#13458"
msgid "Use Decoder filter"
msgstr "Koristi filter dekodera"

#. Description of setting with label #13458 "Use Decoder filter"
msgctxt "#13459"
msgid "Enable/Disable the filter that blocks certain Android software decoders. This filter is configurable via the [userdata]/decoderfilter.xml file."
msgstr "Omogućite/onemogućite filter koji blokira određene Android softverske dekodere. Ovaj filter se može konfigurirati putem datoteke [userdata]/decoderfilter.xml."

