#. Description of setting with label #36099 "Dither"
msgctxt "#36598"
msgid "Eliminate banding caused by RGB level conversion or other processing by adding a small amount of noise to the picture. This can be disabled for slower systems, or when Kodi is set to limited range RGB output and no video processing is needed."
msgstr "Uklonite bendiranje uzrokovano konverzijom RGB nivoa ili drugom obradom dodavanjem male količine šuma slici. Ovo se može onemogućiti za sporije sisteme ili kada je Kodi postavljen na ograničeni RGB izlaz i nije potrebna obrada videa."

#. Description of setting with label #36100 "Dither depth"
msgctxt "#36599"
msgid "Video dithering output precision in bits. Auto enables dithering only when beneficial (limited- / full-range mismatch, bit depth reduction, downscaling, or HDR tone mapping) and uses 8- or 10-bit depth based on what the display supports. Lower settings are available for testing purposes only."
msgstr ""

