#. STR_LIST_OR_TWO
msgctxt "#39910"
msgid "{0} or {1}"
msgstr ""

#. List formatting: pattern used to join the already-combined partial list to the final item in a list of three or more items, e.g. "A, B" + "C" -> "A, B, or C"
